# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: WarArc | Scene: TheBattleForTheCapital

translate zh strings:

    old "A loud battle horn rang out over the battlefield, and as if suddenly recovering all their training, Hassar's army began to move forward as one."
    new "战场上响起了震耳欲聋的号角声，仿佛瞬间唤醒了所有的训练，哈萨尔的军队如同一人般向前推进。"

    old "Speak privately with Varga."
    new "与瓦加私下交谈"

    old "A lady favors wine..."
    new "酒是女人最钟爱的……"

    old "Let's keep drinking. I have some wine in my room."
    new "继续喝吧，我房间里还有酒。"

    old "You don't want it to pass; press on."
    new "不想就此作罢？继续下去。"

    old "Let cooler heads prevail; send Varga away."
    new "让理智占据上风，把瓦尔加送走。"

    old "I think that's enough for me for tonight."
    new "今晚我觉得这样就够了。"

    old "Speak privately with Marion"
    new "与玛里昂私下交谈"

    old "A little under half of the standing army was staffed with bannermen from one of the old houses, and though they were less than half, they made up the strong half."
    new "驻军不到半数来自旧贵族，虽人数不足半，却占了精锐。"

    old "A pause."
    new "沉默。"

    old "A marriage? Between whom?"
    new "婚姻？在谁之间？"

    old "I'll take your proposal into consideration."
    new "我会考虑你的提议。"

    old "This proposal is absurd."
    new "这提议荒谬至极。"

    old "Go back to bed."
    new "回床上去。"

    old "A hail of stone descended on the Rosannan army, splatters of red mist erupted across the entire line."
    new "石雨倾泻在罗萨纳军阵上，整条战线爆发出大片大片的红色血雾。"

    old "A command was given atop the walls for the archers to fire, and together they did."
    new "城墙上发出了命令，弓箭手们开火，他们一同执行。"

    old "A loud battle horn rang out over the field, the battle horn of the Rosanna army."
    new "战场上响起了震耳欲聋的号角声，那是罗莎娜军队的战号。"

    old "Sarah can't do it, she drops the dagger."
    new "莎拉做不到，她丢下了匕首。"

    old "A man wraps his arms around the neck of the soldier between Sarah's legs, violently pulling him away."
    new "一名男子双臂环住莎拉双腿间士兵的脖颈，猛地将他拽开。"

    old "A group of Hassar's soldiers was standing in a circle. In the midsts of the circle, several young women were being violated by the invading soldiers."
    new "一群哈萨尔士兵围成一圈，圆圈中央，几名年轻女子正遭受入侵士兵的凌辱。"

    old "Sarah plunges the dagger into her heart."
    new "莎拉将匕首刺入自己的心脏。"

    old "A moment before they reach her, she topples backwards, her world begins to spin."
    new "就在他们触碰到她之前，她向后倒去，世界开始旋转。"
